N_CITIES            34
POP_SIZE            700
N_GENERATIONS       2000
GENERATE_COORDS     False
COORDS_TYPE         Italy

ENDINPUT

Possible values for field COORDS_TYPE:
- Circular: city coordinates uniformly distributed on a circumference
- Square: city coordinates uniformly distributed inside a Square
- Italy: this coord type is to use only with GENERATE_COORDS set to False. It reads the coordinates from the file "cap_prov_ita.dat" to calculate the route through the italian provinces.

When GENERATE_COORDS is True, coordinates are generated, if it is false, coordinates are read from a file and the content of N_CITIES is irrelevant. The content of COORDS_TYPE is used to read from the correct file.